align="right">&#x0003c;0.01<sup>b</sup></td><td align="right">1.6 &#x000b1; 0.06<sup>a</sup></td><td align="right">&#x0003c;0.01<sup>b</sup></td><td align="right">&#x0003c;0.01<sup>b</sup></td><td align="right">1.3 &#x000b1; 0.04<sup>a </sup>***</td><td align="center">-</td></tr><tr><td align="left">20:4 n-6</td><td align="right">23.1 &#x000b1; 0.73<sup>a</sup></td><td align="right">11.1 &#x000b1; 0.26<sup>c</sup></td><td align="right">14.8 &#x000b1; 0.37<sup>b</sup></td><td align="right">24.8 &#x000b1; 0.34<sup>a </sup>*</td><td align="right">11.6 &#x000b1; 1.45<sup>b</sup></td><td align="right">14.2 &#x000b1; 0.48<sup>c</sup></td><td align="center">-</td></tr><tr><td align="left">20:5 n-3</td><td align="right">&#x0003c;0.01</td><td align="right">0.9 &#x000b1; 0.04</td><td align="right">1.3 &#x000b1; 0.07</td><td align="right">&#x0003c;0.01</td><td align="right">1.0 &#x000b1; 0.12<sup>b</sup></td><td align="right">1.4 &#x000b1; 0.05<sup>a</sup></td><td align="center">-</td></tr><tr><td align="left">22:4 n-6</td><td align="right">1.4 &#x000b1; 0.05<sup>a</sup></td><td align="right">&#x0003c;0.01<sup>b</sup></td><td align="right">&#x0003c;0.01<sup>b</sup></td><td align="right">1.3 &#x000b1; 0.04<sup>a</sup></td><td align="right">&#x0003c;0.01<sup>b</sup></td><td align="right">&#x0003c;0.01<sup>b</sup></td><td align="center">-</td></tr><tr><td align="left">22:5 n-6</td><td align="right">3.2 &#x000b1; 0.24<sup>a</sup></td><td align="right">0.7 &#x000b1; 0.14<sup>b</sup></td><td align="right">&#x0003c;0.01<sup>c</sup></td><td align="right">2.9 &#x000b1; 0.23<sup>a</sup></td><td align="right">0.7 &#x000b1; 0.09<sup>b</sup></td><td align="right">&#x0003c;0.01<sup>c</sup></td><td align="center">-</td></tr><tr><td align="left">22:5 n-3</td><td align="right">0.7 &#x000b1; 0.03<sup>b</sup></td><td align="right">0.9 &#x000b1; 0.05<sup>b</sup></td><td align="right">3.7 &#x000b1; 0.08<sup>a</sup></td><td align="right">0.7 &#x000b1; 0.02<sup>b</sup></td><td align="right">0.7 &#x0